Aquí tens l'aplicació completa FINDIT implementada en un únic fitxer
auto-contingut (findit.html), amb totes les funcionalitats, pantalles, catàlegs,
mapes 2D interactius, algorisme de rutes sense travessar obstacles, cerca
intel·ligent, llistes amb optimització automàtica i flux continu, i sistema de
devolucions que especifica el prompt.

Per provar-la immediatament, copia el codi següent, desa'l com a findit.html i
obre'l amb qualsevol navegador (escriptori o mòbil):

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ca">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <title>FINDIT — Troba productes dins d'establiments</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --blue-primary: #246BCE;
      --blue-dark: #174A91;
      --blue-light: #EAF3FF;
      --blue-pale: #F5F9FF;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
      --gray-light: #F1F3F6;
      --text-secondary: #737B87;
      --text-primary: #202A36;
      --border-soft: #E3E8F0;
      --success: #16A34A;
      --success-bg: #DCFCE7;
      --warning: #D97706;
      --warning-bg: #FEF3C7;
      --danger: #DC2626;
      --danger-bg: #FEE2E2;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(23, 74, 145, 0.06);
      --shadow-md: 0 6px 20px rgba(23, 74, 145, 0.10);
      --radius-lg: 18px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      --radius-sm: 10px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background: #E9EFF7;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      height: 100%;
    }

    /* Mobile-first shell */
    .app-viewport {
      max-width: 440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      height: 100vh;
      height: 100dvh;
      background: var(--blue-pale);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(23, 74, 145, 0.14);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Top context bar when inside a store or subview */
    .top-bar {
      background: var(--white);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      z-index: 20;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .btn-icon {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: transform 0.15s, background 0.15s;
    }
    .btn-icon:active { transform: scale(0.95); background: var(--gray-light); }

    .top-title-wrap { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .top-title {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .top-subtitle {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .store-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Scrollable Main Area */
    .main-content {
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 16px 16px 96px 16px;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    .main-content::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
    .main-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #CBD5E1; border-radius: 4px; }

    /* Fixed Bottom Nav */
    .bottom-nav {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 72px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      align-items: center;
      padding: 4px 4px env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 6px) 4px;
      z-index: 30;
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(23, 74, 145, 0.06);
    }

    .nav-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 4px;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      padding: 6px 2px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      position: relative;
      transition: color 0.15s;
    }
    .nav-item.active { color: var(--blue-primary); }
    .nav-item.active::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -4px;
      width: 28px;
      height: 3px;
      background: var(--blue-primary);
      border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;
    }
    .nav-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: 2px;
      right: 14px;
      background: var(--danger);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      min-width: 17px;
      height: 17px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 4px;
    }

    /* Typography & Cards */
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
    .hero-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-primary), var(--blue-dark));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(36, 107, 206, 0.30);
    }
    .brand-name {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.45;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border: 1px solid rgba(227, 232, 240, 0.8);
    }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin: 22px 0 10px 0;
    }

    /* Home 3 Grouped Options */
    .start-options-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .option-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-soft);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
      width: 100%;
      transition: transform 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    }
    .option-card.primary-opt {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-primary), var(--blue-dark));
      border-color: transparent;
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .option-card:active { transform: scale(0.985); }
    .option-icon-box {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue-primary);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .primary-opt .option-icon-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      color: var(--white);
    }
    .option-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .option-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .primary-opt .option-desc { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }

    /* Recent / Store Cards */
    .store-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      transition: transform 0.15s;
    }
    .store-card:active { transform: scale(0.985); }
    .store-logo {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--white);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Search Input */
    .search-box {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .search-input {
      width: 100%;
      height: 50px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 0 42px 0 44px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.15s;
    }
    .search-input:focus { border-color: var(--blue-primary); }
    .search-icon {
      position: absolute;
      left: 14px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .search-clear {
      position: absolute;
      right: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: none;
      background: var(--gray-light);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: none;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: transform 0.12s, opacity 0.15s;
    }
    .btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--blue-primary);
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(36, 107, 206, 0.28);
    }
    .btn-dark { background: var(--blue-dark); color: var(--white); }
    .btn-light { background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue-dark); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-soft);
    }
    .btn-success {
      background: var(--success);
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.28);
    }
    .btn-danger-outline {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--danger);
      border: 1.5px solid #FECACA;
    }
    .btn-sm {
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      width: auto;
    }

    .btn-grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    /* Category Pills & Product Cards */
    .cat-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .cat-tile {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-align: left;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .cat-dot {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .product-row {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .product-thumb {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .product-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .product-name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .product-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .badge-avail { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success); }
    .badge-low { background: var(--warning-bg); color: var(--warning); }
    .badge-price { background: var(--blue-light); color: var(--blue-dark); }

    /* Location Highlight Box */
    .location-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EAF3FF, #F5F9FF);
      border: 1.5px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 14px;
      margin: 14px 0;
    }
    .location-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--blue-primary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .location-value {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--blue-dark);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* Variant chips */
    .chip-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .chip {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--white);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .chip.selected {
      border-color: var(--blue-primary);
      background: var(--blue-light);
      color: var(--blue-dark);
    }

    /* Progress bar */
    .progress-track {
      width: 100%;
      height: 9px;
      background: var(--gray-light);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue-primary), #38BDF8);
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Directions Steps */
    .step-item {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .step-num {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--blue-primary);
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Map Container */
    .map-wrapper {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .map-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      background: var(--blue-pale);
    }
    .map-viewport {
      width: 100%;
      height: 340px;
      overflow: auto;
      background: #F8FAFC;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .map-legend {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }
    .legend-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
    .legend-swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block; }

    /* QR & GPS Simulators */
    .sim-frame {
      background: #0F172A;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 24px 16px;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .qr-box {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      margin: 14px auto;
      border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      border-radius: 18px;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    .qr-laser {
      position: absolute;
      left: 10px;
      right: 10px;
      height: 3px;
      background: #38BDF8;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px #38BDF8;
      animation: scanMove 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes scanMove {
      0%, 100% { top: 16px; }
      50% { top: 160px; }
    }

    .radar-circle {
      width: 170px;
      height: 170px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin: 14px auto;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(36,107,206,0.35) 0%, rgba(36,107,206,0.06) 70%);
      border: 2px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.4);
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .radar-pulse {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #38BDF8;
      animation: radarPulse 2s infinite ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes radarPulse {
      0% { transform: scale(0.35); opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* Sticky Action Footer for Map / Directions */
    .floating-cta {
      margin-top: 14px;
      position: sticky;
      bottom: 4px;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    /* Modal */
    .modal-backdrop {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.52);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      z-index: 50;
    }
    .modal-box {
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 20px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 360px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .fade-in { animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease-out; }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .empty-state {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 28px 16px;
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px dashed #CBD5E1;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-viewport" id="app"></div>

  <script>
    /* =========================================================================
